  "> Go back to the van. <": {
    "translation": "回到车上去"
  },
  ">Goliath: I must not be defeated...in a place like this..": {
    "translation": "歌莉娅:我绝不能在这样的地方被击败...",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Goliath: Insolent human!You're the one who's going to die!": {
    "translation": "歌莉娅:无礼的人类!你才是那个会死的人!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Goliath: You'll be sorry for this!": {
    "translation": "歌莉娅:你会为此后悔的!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: Yeah,Maybe i will.Sorry I'm about to kill ya!": {
    "translation": "尼禄:是啊,也许我会的.抱歉,我马上就要杀了你!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Goliath: Stop buzzing around!": {
    "translation": "歌莉娅:别再到处嗡嗡叫了!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Goliath: Human..I wasn't expecting any survivors!": {
    "translation": "歌莉娅:人类...我没想到会有幸存者!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  "< Map by @Seth (英俊) >": {
    "translation": "地图作者:Seth(英俊)  翻译:初心心."
  },
  "< Map require keep cs2f_use_old_push enable! >": {
    "translation": "本地图需要启用旧版推力机制!",
    "blocked": true
  },
