  "> Zombie Item's ability unlock in 20 sec. <": {
    "translation": "僵尸神器技能将在20秒后解锁.",
    "countdown": 20
  },
  ">Dante: Round two!": {
    "translation": "但丁:第二轮!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Dante: V,Get Nero out of here!This was a bad move!": {
    "translation": "但丁:神秘人,带尼禄离开这里!我们失算了!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: I can still fight!": {
    "translation": "尼禄:我还能战斗!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Dante: Nero,go!You're just dead weight.": {
    "translation": "但丁:尼禄,走!你只是个累赘.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: Back off!": {
    "translation": "尼禄:退后!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: That bastard called me dead weight!": {
    "translation": "尼禄:那个混蛋说我是累赘!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: I didn't come all this way for nothing!": {
    "translation": "尼禄:我可没白跑这么远!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">V: Stop hitting yourself.": {
    "translation": "神秘人:别再打自己了.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">V: And think of ways to get stronger and actually help.": {
    "translation": "神秘人:想办法让自己变得更强大,真正提供帮助",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">V: If dante loses...you are all that can defeat Urizen.": {
    "translation": "神秘人:如果但丁输了...你是唯一能打败尤里曾的人.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: Is that what you called him?": {
    "translation": "尼禄:你是这么叫他的吗?",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">V: Yes,Urizen,The demon king...": {
    "translation": "神秘人:是的,尤里曾,恶魔之王...",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">V: That's the name of the demon that took your arm.": {
    "translation": "神秘人:那是夺去你手臂的恶魔的名字.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: What am i doin',wasting my time here?He's got this.": {
    "translation": "尼禄:我在做什么,在这里浪费时间?他有这个.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">V: You should not underestimate this demon.": {
    "translation": "神秘人:你不应该低估这个恶魔.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">V: After all,It was he who took your right arm...": {
    "translation": "神秘人:毕竟,是他夺走了你的右臂...",
    "blocked": true
  },
  "V: ...and gained a great deal of power from it.": {
    "translation": "神秘人:...并从中获得了强大的力量.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">V: I'm leaving.": {
    "translation": "神秘人:我要走了.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">V: I'm suggest you do not fall behind.": {
    "translation": "神秘人:我建议你不要落后.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: Yeah...": {
    "translation": "尼禄:是啊...",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: Ok V...You're an interesting guy,But you're right.": {
    "translation": "尼禄:好吧,神秘人...你这家伙挺有意思,不过你说得对.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: I've got a score to settle with that son of a bitch.": {
    "translation": "尼禄:我得去解决那个混蛋.",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: Hey,jackass!": {
    "translation": "尼禄:嘿,混蛋!",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: Didn't your mother ever teach you it's not nice to steal?": {
    "translation": "尼禄:你妈妈没教过你偷东西是不好的吗?",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: Sorry,Dante...": {
    "translation": "尼禄:抱歉,但丁...",
    "blocked": true
  },
  ">Nero: I'm baggin' this bitch!": {
    "translation": "尼禄:我要干掉这个混蛋!",
    "blocked": true
  },
